          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>Moringa does not “work” like a conventional medicine. Instead, its nutritional value comes from the combination of naturally occurring nutrients and plant compounds found in the leaves. When consumed as part of the diet, these nutrients become available to the body through normal digestion and absorption. Vitamins and minerals support numerous ordinary biological processes, while antioxidant compounds help the body manage oxidative stress. The exact nutritional contribution depends on the serving size and the form of moringa being consumed. This is why it is more accurate to describe moringa as a nutrient-rich botanical rather than claiming that it produces one specific effect in everyone.</div><div><br></div><div>One important aspect of moringa is its antioxidant content. Plants naturally produce compounds such as polyphenols to protect themselves, and some of these compounds are also present in foods humans eat. Antioxidants are involved in the body's natural defense against oxidative stress caused by unstable molecules known as free radicals. Moringa leaves contain several plant compounds with antioxidant activity. Including antioxidant-rich foods in a varied diet can therefore contribute to overall nutritional quality. However, consuming moringa does not mean that oxidative stress is completely eliminated, and individual results can vary depending on diet and lifestyle.</div><div><br></div><div>Moringa also provides a selection of vitamins and minerals that participate in normal body functions. For example, nutrients such as calcium and potassium are associated with normal physiological processes, while vitamin E contributes to protection of cells from oxidative stress. Iron is involved in normal oxygen transport, although the amount of iron actually absorbed from plant foods can vary. These nutrients work as part of the body's larger nutritional system rather than operating independently. This is one reason why moringa is best used alongside a balanced diet containing vegetables, fruits, whole grains, protein sources, and healthy fats.</div><div><br></div><div>Another way to understand moringa is to look at how it fits into everyday nutrition. Many people struggle to consistently eat a wide variety of nutrient-dense foods because of busy schedules, limited food choices, or personal preferences. Moringa powder or capsules can provide a convenient botanical option that requires little preparation. That convenience may make it easier for some people to maintain a consistent wellness routine. Still, a supplement should complement nutritious meals rather than replace them. Moringa works best as one small part of an overall approach to healthy eating and regular daily habits.</div><div><br></div><div>The body's response to any food or supplement can differ from one person to another. Factors such as diet, age, lifestyle, existing medications, and individual sensitivity can influence how someone responds to moringa. For this reason, it is better to focus on its nutritional qualities rather than expecting a specific outcome. Choosing a reputable product, following the suggested serving size, and using moringa consistently as part of a balanced routine are sensible approaches. Anyone who takes medication or has a medical condition should discuss the use of concentrated moringa supplements with an appropriate healthcare professional.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
